{
  "id": "nce2-l75",
  "title": "Lesson 75: SOS",
  "audio": "/audio/nce2/75－SOS.mp3",
  "image": "/images/nce2/l75/scene1.jpg",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "intro_1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "How did the woman get help?",
      "translation": "那位妇女是如何获得帮助的？",
      "startTime": 10.24,
      "endTime": 14.44,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "How",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "怎样，如何"
          },
          {
            "word": "Woman",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "女人"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "When a light passenger plane flew off course some time ago,",
      "translation": "不久前，一架轻型客机偏离了航线，",
      "startTime": 14.45,
      "endTime": 19.67
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "it crashed in the mountains and its pilot was killed.",
      "translation": "在山区坠毁，飞行员丧生。",
      "startTime": 19.68,
      "endTime": 25.24,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The only passengers, a young woman and her two baby daughters, were unhurt.",
      "translation": "机上仅有的乘客，一位年轻妇女和她的两个小女儿，却安然无恙。",
      "startTime": 25.25,
      "endTime": 33.5,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Young",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "年轻的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Woman",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "女人"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It was the middle of winter.",
      "translation": "当时正值隆冬。",
      "startTime": 33.51,
      "endTime": 36.07,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Snow lay thick on the ground.",
      "translation": "地上积满了厚厚的雪。",
      "startTime": 36.08,
      "endTime": 39.76
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The woman knew that the nearest village was miles away.",
      "translation": "那位妇女知道最近的村庄也有好几英里远。",
      "startTime": 39.77,
      "endTime": 45.04,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Woman",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "女人"
          },
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "When it grew dark, she turned a suitcase into a bed and put the children inside it,",
      "translation": "天黑下来时，她把一个手提箱变成了床，把孩子们放进去，",
      "startTime": 45.05,
      "endTime": 53.19,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "covering them with all the clothes she could find.",
      "translation": "用她能找到的所有衣服盖在孩子们身上。",
      "startTime": 53.2,
      "endTime": 57.92
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "During the night, it got terribly cold.",
      "translation": "夜里，天变得非常冷。",
      "startTime": 57.93,
      "endTime": 62.46,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Cold",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "冷的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The woman kept as near as she could to the children and even tried to get into the case herself, but it was too small.",
      "translation": "那位妇女尽量靠近孩子们，甚至想自己钻进箱子里，但箱子太小了。",
      "startTime": 62.47,
      "endTime": 74.03,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Woman",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "女人"
          },
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Too",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "也"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Early next morning,",
      "translation": "第二天一大早，",
      "startTime": 74.04,
      "endTime": 75.78
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "she heard planes passing overhead and wondered how she could send a signal.",
      "translation": "她听到飞机从头顶飞过，不知道怎样才能发出一个信号。",
      "startTime": 75.79,
      "endTime": 82.69,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "How",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "怎样，如何"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Then she had an idea. She stamped out the letters 'SOS' in the snow.",
      "translation": "然后她想出了一个主意。她在雪地里踩出了'SOS'这几个字母。",
      "startTime": 82.7,
      "endTime": 91.97
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Fortunately, a pilot saw the signal and sent a message by radio to the nearest town.",
      "translation": "幸运的是，一个飞行员看到了这个信号，用无线电向最近的城镇发了一条消息。",
      "startTime": 91.98,
      "endTime": 100.46
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "It was not long before a helicopter arrived on the scene to rescue the survivors of the plane crash.",
      "translation": "不久，一架直升机飞到了现场，营救坠机事故中的幸存者。",
      "startTime": 100.47,
      "endTime": 105.47,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
